              "id": "CVE-2026-15308-python-3.12",
              "name": "ApkMatcherCpeMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-15308 high vulnerability for python-3.12 package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "The incremental HTML parser (html.parser.HTMLParser) allows for CPU\ndenial-of-service through repeated unterminated markup declarations when\nprocessing uncontrolled data."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anchore/grype",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-15308\nSeverity: high\nPackage: python-3.12\nVersion: 3.12.13-r10\nFix Version: \nType: apk\nLocation: /usr/lib/apk/db/installed\nData Namespace: nvd:cpe\nLink: [CVE-2026-15308](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-15308)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-15308**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| high  | python-3.12  | 3.12.13-r10  |   | apk  | /usr/lib/apk/db/installed  | nvd:cpe  | [CVE-2026-15308](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-15308)  |\n"
